{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "mhtms-api-v1-collection",
    "name": "MHTMS API v1",
    "description": "Municipal Health & Triage Management System — REST API v1.\n\n## Setup\n1. Import this collection only.\n2. Edit collection variables if needed and set `base_url` (local: http://127.0.0.1:8000).\n3. Run **Auth → Login (Doctor)** — tokens are saved automatically to collection variables.\n4. Use **Patients → List Patients** and copy a UUID into `patient_id` for detail requests.\n\n## Docs\n- Markdown: `docs/API_DOCUMENTATION.md`\n- Swagger UI: `{{base_url}}/api/docs/`\n\n## Demo accounts (after `seed_demo`)\n| Email | Role | Password |\n|-------|------|----------|\n| doctor@mhtms.gov.ph | Doctor | DemoPass123! |\n| nurse@mhtms.gov.ph | Nurse | DemoPass123! |\n| reception@mhtms.gov.ph | Receptionist | DemoPass123! |\n| admin@mhtms.gov.ph | Super Admin | DemoPass123! |",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{access_token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('base_url')) {",
          "    pm.collectionVariables.set('base_url', 'http://127.0.0.1:8000');",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {"key": "base_url", "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000"},
    {"key": "access_token", "value": ""},
    {"key": "refresh_token", "value": ""},
    {"key": "patient_id", "value": ""},
    {"key": "consultation_id", "value": ""},
    {"key": "triage_id", "value": ""},
    {"key": "doctor_email", "value": "doctor@mhtms.gov.ph"},
    {"key": "doctor_password", "value": "DemoPass123!"},
    {"key": "nurse_email", "value": "nurse@mhtms.gov.ph"},
    {"key": "nurse_password", "value": "DemoPass123!"},
    {"key": "api_email", "value": "api@mhtms.gov.ph"},
    {"key": "api_password", "value": "DemoPass123!"},
    {"key": "reception_email", "value": "reception@mhtms.gov.ph"},
    {"key": "reception_password", "value": "DemoPass123!"}
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "JWT authentication (email + password). Access token lifetime is configured in Django settings; use refresh when expired.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (Doctor)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', data.access);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', data.refresh);",
                  "    console.log('Tokens saved to collection variables.');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {"type": "noauth"},
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{doctor_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{doctor_password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login/",
            "description": "Obtain JWT access + refresh tokens. Uses `doctor_email` / `doctor_password` from collection variables."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (Nurse)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', data.access);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', data.refresh);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {"type": "noauth"},
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{nurse_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{nurse_password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (API Consumer)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', data.access);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', data.refresh);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {"type": "noauth"},
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{api_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{api_password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login/",
            "description": "API Consumer role — health-stats returns masked PHI only."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (Receptionist)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', data.access);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', data.refresh);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {"type": "noauth"},
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{reception_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{reception_password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', data.access);",
                  "    if (data.refresh) pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', data.refresh);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {"type": "noauth"},
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refresh\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/refresh/",
            "description": "Rotate access token. Old refresh may be blacklisted if ROTATE_REFRESH_TOKENS is enabled."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Profile (Me)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/profile/",
            "description": "Current user profile (role, clinic, email)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refresh\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/logout/",
            "description": "Blacklist refresh token and audit logout."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Patients",
      "description": "Patient CRUD with Anti-IDOR scoping. Doctors only see assigned patients; nurses/reception see clinic patients.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Patients",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "    const list = Array.isArray(data) ? data : (data.results || []);",
                  "    if (list.length && list[0].id) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('patient_id', list[0].id);",
                  "        console.log('patient_id set to first result:', list[0].id);",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/patients/?search=&ordering=-created_at",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "patients", ""],
              "query": [
                {"key": "search", "value": "", "description": "Name or patient number"},
                {"key": "ordering", "value": "-created_at"},
                {"key": "gender", "value": "male", "disabled": true},
                {"key": "page", "value": "1", "disabled": true}
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Patient",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201 && pm.response.json().id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('patient_id', pm.response.json().id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"first_name\": \"Maria\",\n  \"middle_name\": \"\",\n  \"last_name\": \"Santos\",\n  \"birth_date\": \"1992-06-15\",\n  \"gender\": \"female\",\n  \"address\": \"Carigara, Leyte\",\n  \"contact_number\": \"+639171234567\",\n  \"emergency_contact\": \"Juan Santos\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/patients/",
            "description": "Receptionist, Nurse, or Super Admin only."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Patient by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/patients/{{patient_id}}/",
            "description": "Returns 403/404 if user cannot access this UUID (Anti-IDOR demo)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Patient (PATCH)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"contact_number\": \"+639189999999\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/patients/{{patient_id}}/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Archive Patient (DELETE)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/patients/{{patient_id}}/",
            "description": "Soft-archive via PatientService."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Patient Queue (Triage Waiting)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/patients/queue/",
            "description": "Clinical staff only — patients with active triage in waiting/escalated/in_progress."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Triage",
      "description": "Nurse / Super Admin. Creates triage with auto severity scoring.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Triage Records",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const list = Array.isArray(pm.response.json()) ? pm.response.json() : (pm.response.json().results || []);",
                  "    if (list[0] && list[0].id) pm.collectionVariables.set('triage_id', list[0].id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/triage/?severity_level=critical",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "triage", ""],
              "query": [
                {"key": "severity_level", "value": "critical", "disabled": true},
                {"key": "triage_status", "value": "waiting", "disabled": true}
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Triage",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201 && pm.response.json().id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('triage_id', pm.response.json().id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"patient\": \"{{patient_id}}\",\n  \"blood_pressure\": \"140/90\",\n  \"heart_rate\": 88,\n  \"respiratory_rate\": 18,\n  \"oxygen_saturation\": \"96\",\n  \"body_temperature\": \"37.8\",\n  \"symptoms\": \"Fever, cough\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/triage/",
            "description": "Set `patient_id` first. Nurse role required."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Triage Record",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/triage/{{triage_id}}/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Vitals (PATCH)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"blood_pressure\": \"130/85\",\n  \"symptoms\": \"Fever improving\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/triage/{{triage_id}}/"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Consultations",
      "description": "Doctor only (receptionist denied). Includes admit, discharge, bulk discharge.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Consultations",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const list = Array.isArray(pm.response.json()) ? pm.response.json() : (pm.response.json().results || []);",
                  "    if (list[0] && list[0].id) pm.collectionVariables.set('consultation_id', list[0].id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/consultations/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Consultation",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201 && pm.response.json().id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('consultation_id', pm.response.json().id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"patient\": \"{{patient_id}}\",\n  \"diagnosis\": \"Acute viral URI\",\n  \"treatment\": \"Rest, fluids, paracetamol PRN\",\n  \"prescription\": \"Paracetamol 500mg PO q6h x 3 days\",\n  \"consultation_notes\": \"Return if worsening\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/consultations/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Consultation",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/consultations/{{consultation_id}}/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Admit Patient",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/consultations/{{consultation_id}}/admit/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Discharge Patient",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/consultations/{{consultation_id}}/discharge/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Bulk Discharge",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"consultation_ids\": [\n    \"{{consultation_id}}\"\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/consultations/bulk-discharge/",
            "description": "Up to 100 UUIDs; per-ID permission checks."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Analytics",
      "description": "Authenticated clinic stats; regional stats are public aggregate data.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Clinic Statistics",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/analytics/clinic/?clinic_id=",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "analytics", "clinic", ""],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "clinic_id",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "Optional; defaults to user's clinic"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Health Stats (Unmasked — Doctor)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/analytics/health-stats/?region=Region VIII",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "analytics", "health-stats", ""],
              "query": [{"key": "region", "value": "Region VIII"}]
            },
            "description": "Requires Doctor/Nurse/Admin JWT. data_classification=clinical_full, real patient_name and sample_cases."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Health Stats (Masked — API Consumer)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/analytics/health-stats/?region=Region VIII",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "analytics", "health-stats", ""],
              "query": [{"key": "region", "value": "Region VIII"}]
            },
            "description": "Run Login (API Consumer) first. Same URL — patient_name becomes HIPAA Restricted."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Regional Statistics",
          "request": {
            "auth": {"type": "noauth"},
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/analytics/regional/?region=Region VIII",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "analytics", "regional", ""],
              "query": [{"key": "region", "value": "Region VIII"}]
            },
            "description": "No auth required — aggregate counts only."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Severity Distribution",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/analytics/severity/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Patient Trends",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/analytics/trends/"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Public (Masked)",
      "description": "No authentication. PHI fields are replaced with \"HIPAA Restricted\".",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Masked Health Stats",
          "request": {
            "auth": {"type": "noauth"},
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/public/health-stats/?region=Region VIII",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "public", "health-stats", ""],
              "query": [{"key": "region", "value": "Region VIII"}]
            },
            "description": "Defense demo: compare with authenticated analytics — no PHI exposed."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Defense Demos",
      "description": "Suggested flow for capstone presentation (Member 2 — API & IAM).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1 — Login Doctor",
          "request": {
            "auth": {"type": "noauth"},
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"email\": \"doctor@mhtms.gov.ph\", \"password\": \"DemoPass123!\"}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2 — List Patients (Mine)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/patients/"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3 — IDOR Test (Other Clinic Patient UUID)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/patients/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/",
            "description": "Replace UUID with one from another doctor's patient (seed data). Expect 403 or 404."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4 — Health Stats Unmasked (Doctor JWT)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/analytics/health-stats/?region=Region+VIII"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "5 — Health Stats Masked (API Consumer JWT)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/analytics/health-stats/?region=Region+VIII",
            "description": "Login as api@mhtms.gov.ph first."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "6 — Public Masked Stats (No Auth)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {"type": "noauth"},
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/public/health-stats/?region=Region+VIII"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
